  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response Mechanism (ERM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Emergency Response Mechanism will complement the ERM funded by ECHO and is an emergency response mechanism for Ethiopia. Funding will be made available for INGO/NGO/LNGO&apos;s to apply to in response to emergencies across the country.  While it will work alongside ECHO- ERM, it will be a separate funding pot.</narrative>
